  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Liu tribe Gu Immortal asks him whether Nian Er Ping Zhi is the newest generation Sword Child from Nian Er tribe. While Nian Er Ping Zhi fights Old Monster Corpse Poison, Nian Er Fu takes Qing Xuan Zi’s corpse into his immortal aperture for the dao marks, calling himself greedy even as a rank seven senior. Nian Er tribe’s Nian Er Ping Zhi and Nian Er Fu are named exceptions among the righteous path in that battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "sys_sword_child",
        "fac_nian_er_tribe",
        "char_old_monster_corpse_poison",
        "char_qing_xuan_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has the appearance of a chubby boy and waves fat little arms, while speaking with an aged tone.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a space path Gu Immortal with deep cultivation and many methods. He loots resources across the battlefield and protects Nian Er Ping Zhi from a fatal blow by Old Monster Corpse Poison, attacking dozens of times and secretly injuring that foe. With space path power he pulls an iron crown eagle into his immortal aperture without resistance.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "space-path-support",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Near the end of the Hei tribe collapse he grabs the unconscious Nian Er Ping Zhi and sneakily retreats.",
      "chapters": [
        1109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "space-path-support",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the blood battle martial competition he arrives again, and wood path Gu Immortal Nian Er Yi Fang comes with him.",
      "chapters": [
        1193
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-plain-presence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
